      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Ray Cooke Auctioneers are delighted to offer to the open market this fantastically located and well-presented three bedroom semi-detached property in the highly desirable residential development of Yellow Meadows, Clondalkin, Dublin 22. This ideal location proves ever popular with a vast array of buyers as it finds itself within close proximity of Clondalkin Village and its large variety of local amenities including The Mill Shopping Centre, Clondalkin Leisure Centre, esteemed primary & secondary schools, and a host of bars, cafes and restaurants. Transport wise, bus routes to and from Dublin City Centre are within a short stroll and both The Luas & The M50 Motorway are very easily accessible. Bright, open and spacious internal living accommodation of c. 83 Sq m can be found here and in brief consists of; Entrance porch, entrance hall, kitchen/diner with lean to and a living room to the ground floor. Upstairs you will find three bedrooms with two being great sized doubles and the family bathroom. Externally this property benefits from a fully enclosed, low maintenance rear garden with a brick built storage unit and side access to the front which offer a driveway for off road parking. No. 7 comes to the market in great condition throughout and has been meticulously maintained and upgraded by its current owner. Based on size, spec and location we know this will be extremely popular so please contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers to register your interest and book a viewing.\r\n\r\n\r\nFeatures\r\n\r\nBER D1\r\nc. 83 sqm\r\n3 Bed\r\nSemi-detached\r\nEasy access to N7 & M50\r\nGas central heating\r\nMature development\r\nClose to amenities\r\nWalking distance to Clondalkin Village\r\nDriveway for off road parking\r\nFantastic opportunity\r\nDouble glazed windows\r\nCall today to arrange a viewing!\r\n\r\nDirections\r\nFrom Clondalkin Village centre, head down Watery Lane, when you reach the T-junction with Woodford Walk, take a right and then your 2nd left will be in to the Yellow Meadows Development."
      },
      {
